Intended use
------------
This map is intended to use with Bacteriochlorophyll c (bChl-c) molecules. It provides the electronic excitation energy and corresponding energy fluctuation due to changes in the molecule's electrostatic environment.

How to use
----------
This map has no specific requirements beyond the availability of the bChl-c electrostatic environment

Available parameters
--------------------
At this point the map has no additional parameters available.

Warnings that can be raised by this map
---------------------------------------
At this point none
